function [a] = tb_battin(s, b, gm)
%TB_BATTIN  thirdbody.battin(rSat, rBody, GM): the third body's acceleration in Battin's stable form.
%   s: real[1][3] (passed a plain number)
%   b: real[1][3] (passed a plain number)
